    {
      "id": "ollie-c-extend-chest",
      "kind": "stage",
      "title": "C · Extend further down the chest",
      "context": "We stopped just past the apex of his chest to stay clear of the 13th rib.",
      "problem": "We did not want the socket past his 13th rib where it could press on his organs, so we went only a little past the apex of his chest. That may leave too little socket to hold it steady.",
      "proposal": "Extend the socket an extra inch or two down his chest, still well clear of the 13th rib. Click the animal and press T to make it solid or see-through.",
      "ask": "How far down can we safely go, and which landmark would you use to set that limit?",
