    {
      "id": "ollie-e-stiffer-ribs",
      "kind": "stage",
      "title": "E · Stiffer where it pushes on the ribs",
      "context": "The socket may be flexing instead of holding its position.",
      "problem": "If the socket flexes, it cannot push against his ribs to keep the leg pointed the right way.",
      "proposal": "Thicken the wall near the pelvic end. Two nTop inputs control it: pelvic thickness (how much thicker) and pelvic thicken distance (how far the thickening reaches). Use the two bars under the sweep model; every combination shown was generated in nTop. At 0 thickness the distance changes nothing.",
      "ask": "Is stiffness the right thing to change here? Where on the socket would you add it?",
